#   - DISPATCH replay: decode m=2051, ext m=2051 n=2/n=8, mm m=1027 n=32/n=512; every output row
#     reads its own src0 row exactly once: DECODE/EXT/MM_DISPATCH_REPLAY_OK
#   - DISPATCH GATE replay: a repacked Q4_K src0 takes the ext path for every n (the nc2 rows
#     test is bypassed), so n=2 never diverts to the canonical nc2 kernel; canonical n=2 still
