#     'q4k-repack: mark <name> ...' line per tensor.
#     NOT RUN here (no cmake build, no test-backend-ops); compile-checked only.
#   - mixed fused-QKV (q4_K/q6_K/q4_K): not added as a test-backend-ops case. The fused QKV path
#     is reached only through a specific q/k/v graph with a shared src1 and single-token planes,
